"k": "1491",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I mean, between the damage to the room, gettin' me glamour bill settled... and I don't even want to talk about the bleedin' car, it's been a bit of financial disaster."
},
{
"k": "1492",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
