"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This?"
},
{
"k": "1494",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[tired] Came from the trophy case. It looked valuable. And yes, I cut my finger getting it. Happy?"
