},
{
"k": "1600",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Was it the same guy from the closet?"
},
{
"k": "1601",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Some fat bloke. Came looking for the Woodsman, found me instead. Fuckin' hell. Nearly took me bloody head off. Wore a hat. Had a shirt on."
},
{
"k": "1602",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "A shirt? That's not very specific."
},
{
"k": "1603",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No. He was wearing a tan shirt. It was his brother. Dum."
},
{
"k": "1604",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Yeah. Sounds like it."
},
{
"k": "1605",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Not in front of Toad"
},
{
"k": "1606",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[shutting it down] Ongoing investigation. I'd rather not discuss it in front of..."
},
{
"k": "1607",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Oh..."
},
{
"k": "1608",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The both of you can piss off."
},
{
"k": "1609",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The rest of us do, though."
},
{
"k": "1610",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "If you don't know, Bigby, just say so. I don't expect you to have all the answers."
},
{
"k": "1611",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Well, it is appreciated, Miss."
},
{
"k": "1612",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm... taking a more active interest."
},
{
"k": "1613",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "What're you doing here, Miss White?"
},
{
"k": "1614",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I've never seen you on this end of town."
},
{
"k": "1615",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It just happened, how can you not be sure."
},
{
"k": "1616",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Cause the fella was bangin' on me bleedin' head, Miss. I didn't know there'd be a quiz later."
},
{
"k": "1617",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Wait. Wait... Trip Trap. I think he was asking me about that."
},
{
"k": "1618",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He wanted to know what it was. I had no clue, then he started in on me."
},
{
"k": "1619",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm sorry."
},
{
"k": "1620",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's a bar."
},
{
"k": "1621",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's his regular spot."
},
{
"k": "1622",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He's a regular there. It's a bar."
},
{
"k": "1623",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "How the hell do you know that?"
},
{
"k": "1624",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bar tab"
},
{
"k": "1625",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Might be for a few days knowing how that bastard goes."
},
{
"k": "1626",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's his bar tab. This is at least a few weeks of heavy drinking."
},
{
"k": "1627",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Matchbook"
},
{
"k": "1628",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Trust me."
},
{
"k": "1629",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The matchbook. Trip Trap."
},
{
"k": "1630",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "But there are a lot of them..."
},
{
"k": "1631",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Not your business."
},
{
"k": "1632",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "That's for me to know and for you to stop giving a shit about, Toad."
},
{
"k": "1633",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's where I'm going next."
},
{
"k": "1634",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's on this matchbook and it's all we've got to go on."
},
{
"k": "1635",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "That guy's trouble, Miss White."
},
{
"k": "1636",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"k": "1637",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm going to call a cab."
},
{
"k": "1638",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He's the type you ask to solve a problem and it's worse off by the time he leaves."
},
{
"k": "1639",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He means well, don't get me wrong. But he's got bad luck... bad enough to make it so you've got bad luck. You'll see."
},
{
"k": "1640",
"who": "PHONE VOICE",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Hello?"
},
{
"k": "1641",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He only cares about himself. Don't let this Sheriff shit fool you. He's still a wolf underneath there."
},
{
"k": "1642",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Yeah, I need a cab at West 127th and Andersen."
},
{
"k": "1643",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This thing's in a pretty bad shape."
},
{
"k": "1644",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You broke it."
},
{
"k": "1645",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No idea. Sorry."
},
{
"k": "1646",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I didn't!"
},
{
"k": "1647",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "So what was in here?"
},
{
"k": "1648",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No... I just said I cut my thumb on the glass. I don't know about the other thing."
},
{
"k": "1649",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You told me you did!"
},
{
"k": "1650",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It was a splinter! For fuck's sake."
},
{
"k": "1651",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Nope. Didn't know it was in there."
},
{
"k": "1652",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You touch this?"
},
{
"k": "1653",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Someone's been in my crime scene."
},
{
"k": "1654",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Fresh."
},
{
"k": "1655",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[suspicion]Yeah... Except. The cupboard was closed."
},
{
"k": "1656",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Probably the guy who tossed the place."
},
{
"k": "1657",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "What?"
},
{
"k": "1658",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Smashed to shit."
},
{
"k": "1659",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This smells like you, Toad."
},
{
"k": "1660",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I own the building! The whole bloody place smells like me."
},
{
"k": "1661",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[beat]You know what I mean."
},
{
"k": "1662",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bullshit"
},
{
"k": "1663",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Whose blood is it, then?"
},
{
"k": "1664",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Maybe his."
},
{
"k": "1665",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Never mind."
},
{
"k": "1666",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The blood is yours. You've been in this cupboard."
},
{
"k": "1667",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Yeah, it was open. I was curious. Stupid mistake."
},
{
"k": "1668",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[warning]Don't lie to me again, Toad."
},
{
"k": "1669",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[warning] If I find out you messed up my crime scene…"
},
{
"k": "1670",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Take"
},
{
"k": "1671",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Uncrumple"
},
{
"k": "1672",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's an award or proclamation or something. For \"Bravery.\" Top's ripped off, though."
},
{
"k": "1673",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Turn Over"
},
{
"k": "1674",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "What? What is it?"
},
{
"k": "1675",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Is this your blood?"
},
{
"k": "1676",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[standing his ground] Yeah."
},
{
"k": "1677",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[standing his ground]No, mate. I didn't touch nothin' in here."
},
{
"k": "1678",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Just a coincidence?"
},
{
"k": "1679",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm gonna ask you again..."
},
{
"k": "1680",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Did you touch this?"
},
{
"k": "1681",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No, I never seen that."
},
{
"k": "1682",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Know what this is?"
},
{
"k": "1683",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Or his."
},
{
"k": "1684",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Got a bloody print on it. Could be yours."
},
{
"k": "1685",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Nope."
},
{
"k": "1686",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Any idea what this is?"
},
{
"k": "1687",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[ACCUSE]"
},
{
"k": "1688",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Blood"
},
{
"k": "1689",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It doesn't add up. Your blood over there. And this splinter story."
},
{
"k": "1690",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[shrugs]Don't know what to say, mate."
},
{
"k": "1691",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I don't like that look much."
},
{
"k": "1692",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You're gonna tell me what you messed with, and give it back. Right now."
},
{
"k": "1693",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Or what?"
},
{
"k": "1694",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm done with this."
},
{
"k": "1695",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[Threaten]"
},
{
"k": "1696",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[violently angry] Now gimme what I want or I'm gonna tear your fucking throat out!"
},
{
"k": "1697",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bigby, please."
},
{
"k": "1698",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bigby, stop! He's had enough already."
},
{
"k": "1699",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Really? Worse than this?"
},
{
"k": "1700",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Continue this downtown?"
},
{
"k": "1701",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Or we're going to continue this in my damn office."
},
{
"k": "1702",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Help me."
},
{
"k": "1703",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[exasperated] Or a girl's murderer goes free. Why the hell are you playing games? Help me out, Toad."
},
{
"k": "1704",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Mister Toad, if you've accidentally picked something up..."
},
{
"k": "1705",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You see what I'm dealing with."
},
{
"k": "1706",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Then it's my property."
},
{
"k": "1707",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Look, you can bluster all you want."
},
{
"k": "1708",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The proclamation fit.."
},
{
"k": "1709",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's... more complicated than that, Sheriff."
},
{
"k": "1710",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The proclamation had your thumbprints. And it fit the trophy case. You messed with it."
},
{
"k": "1711",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You lied to me."
},
{
"k": "1712",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Every single thing you said was a lie. Don't need any more proof than that."
},
{
"k": "1713",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[bitter bitter bitter] I guess not. Great detective work."
},
{
"k": "1714",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Your blood in the cupboard."
},
{
"k": "1715",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Your blood was in the cupboard. So was the trophy case. Found the crumpled proclamation with your prints. C'mon."
},
{
"k": "1716",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Whatever."
},
{
"k": "1717",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[Don't need proof.]"
},
{
"k": "1718",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[bitter] Guess you don't need proof, when you're the only law in town."
},
{
"k": "1719",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I stashed it under the bed. Earlier. Before... everything."
},
{
"k": "1720",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Where's your proof?"
},
{
"k": "1721",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[warning] Sit tight, Toad. We've got some things to clear up when I'm through here."
},
{
"k": "1722",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[from off] It's just a jacket."
},
{
"k": "1723",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[grunt] Hnt."
},
{
"k": "1724",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Wish I knew which one of you belonged to which."
},
{
"k": "1725",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Well... you are."
},
{
"k": "1726",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You like digging through other people's trash?"
},
{
"k": "1727",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "So... Are you here about my car?"
},
{
"k": "1728",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Looking for the Woodsman"
},
{
"k": "1729",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No. I'm looking for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "1730",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Me too. I popped round this morning. But I don't think he came back around last night."
},
{
"k": "1731",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Where did he go?"
},
{
"k": "1732",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No. But... you can have your keys back now."
},
{
"k": "1733",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Sorry about that."
},
{
"k": "1734",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Fucking good this will do me."
},
{
"k": "1735",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[softer] Look. File a damage report with the Business Office."
},
{
"k": "1736",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Then I'll see what I can do."
},
{
"k": "1737",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "No."
},
{
"k": "1738",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Well..."
},
{
"k": "1739",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "My poor car..."
},
{
"k": "1740",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "So what are you here for?"
},
{
"k": "1741",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You had a busy night.... a big fight, lots of noise. Sirens. [looks around, leans in] And an incident on the steps of the Woodlands. Seriously... what's going on?"
},
{
"k": "1742",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Help me track Woodsman"
},
{
"k": "1743",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Like I said, I'm looking for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "1744",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm looking for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "1745",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He's wanted in connection with a murder."
},
{
"k": "1746",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This could be a crime scene."
},
{
"k": "1747",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This is a criminal investigation now, Toad. I'm not at liberty to say."
},
{
"k": "1748",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Oh, so now it's Mr Sheriff?"
},
{
"k": "1749",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I want information"
},
{
"k": "1750",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Tell me what you know."
},
{
"k": "1751",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Not much. But I do know that that poor girl from last night was killed. Shame. No one deserves that."
},
{
"k": "1752",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "And you're looking for the Woodsman... I can see why. He's a violent man."
},
{
"k": "1753",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "And you're looking for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "1754",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I never said that."
},
{
"k": "1755",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Nevertheless... [he gestures at the room.] Here you are."
},
{
"k": "1756",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[annoyed] Hmm."
},
{
"k": "1757",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Kind of a know it all, aren't ya?"
},
{
"k": "1758",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Knowledge is power, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "1759",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Well, you're a pretty powerful guy."
},
{
"k": "1760",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Fuck off."
},
{
"k": "1761",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "You wanna keep your secrets? Fine. I'll keep mine too."
},
{
"k": "1762",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Come on, mate."
},
{
"k": "1763",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Level with me."
},
{
"k": "1764",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Who are you looking for?"
},
{
"k": "1765",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Alright. We'll try this out. Tell me if you hear anything about the Woodsman..."
},
{
"k": "1766",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Can I help you?"
},
{
"k": "1767",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I don't know what you're gonna do with any of that shit, but hopefully you got somewhere to start."
},
{
"k": "1768",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's a start."
},
{
"k": "1769",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bloody hell, hold on."
},
{
"k": "1770",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm leaving anyway."
},
{
"k": "1771",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Who am I?"
},
{
"k": "1772",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Listen here, Love, you called me, and I asked first."
},
{
"k": "1773",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Look, you sound nice, so let me—oh, dreadfully sorry Miss. [beat] Yes, he's right here."
},
{
"k": "1774",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "It's Miss White."
},
{
"k": "1775",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Hey, Snow."
},
{
"k": "1776",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Oh yeah, yeah, come right this way."
},
{
"k": "1777",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I've just found out where this girl lives. I should go talk to her husband."
},
{
"k": "1778",
"who": "DUM",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Hmm? Yeah, I was… lookin' for a room for rent."
},
{
"k": "1779",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Sorry. I gotta follow up on this."
},
{
"k": "1780",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Stay outta sight."
},
{
"k": "1781",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Maybe you're right."
},
{
"k": "1782",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This is exactly what I was talking about."
},
{
"k": "1783",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Outta sight."
},
{
"k": "1784",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I'm fine."
},
{
"k": "1785",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "This isn't a debate."
},
{
"k": "1786",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[to Snow, to get her attention] Hey."
},
{
"k": "1787",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[heavy breathing] What the hell..."
},
{
"k": "1788",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[heavy breathing, whispered] I don't deserve this..."
},
{
"k": "1789",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Fuck! He's gone?"
},
{
"k": "1790",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Appears that way."
},
{
"k": "1791",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[alarmed] Fuck!"
},
{
"k": "1792",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "What?!"
},
{
"k": "1793",
"who": "TOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "[sad and small] I just fixed it."
},
{
"k": "1794",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I mean. Obviously, it's fine. What you did. To the door."
},
{
"k": "1795",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "He's clearly not here. But... [transitions to another exchange]"
},
{
"k": "1796",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Shit man. I wasn't wasting your time here. The fucker must've jumped out the window."
},
{
"k": "1797",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I was planning on coming by anyway."
},
{
"k": "1798",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Wait, what? Oh. [beat]"
},
{
"k": "1799",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Hey, sorry about all this, Bigby. You can't blame a guy for trying to... mitigate his losses."
},
{
"k": "1800",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "What happened with the car?"
},
{
"k": "1801",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I smashed it."
},
{
"k": "1802",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "The Woodsman landed on it."
},
{
"k": "1803",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Oh. Well, if the Woodsman caused the damage then there really isn't anything we can do. Your grievance is with him."
},
{
"k": "1804",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Wait, you're saying if Bigby was the one that fell on it, I'd be reimbursed."
},
{
"k": "1805",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Of course."
},
{
"k": "1806",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I wish I knew that earlier, [looks at Bigby] I would've slipped you a tenner to say it was you."
},
{
"k": "1807",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Let us reimburse you."
},
{
"k": "1808",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "I think it's only right that we reimburse him for his damages."
},
{
"k": "1809",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Well, I'm sure if Bigby was at fault, he'd say so."
},
{
"k": "1810",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "If I knew, I wouldn't be askin'."
},
{
"k": "1811",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Right. [to Toad] If you see that fat guy again, call right away."
},
{
"k": "1812",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Well, we should go. We want to make sure we get to Lawrence before..."
},
{
"k": "1813",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "That's me returnin' a favor."
},
{
"k": "1814",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "That's the name he said. The fat prick was here earlier. He said something about a Lawrence. I'd hurry if I was you."
},
{
"k": "1815",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bigby!"
},
{
"k": "1816",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Lawrence."
},
{
"k": "1817",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Not sure what good it'll do... but yeah. Sure, Bigby. I'll call."
},
{
"k": "1818",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Who is this?"
},
{
"k": "1819",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Bigby, stop."
},
{
"k": "1820",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Alright. Lay off a bit, yeah."
},
{
"k": "1821",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "We all seem to be searching for the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "1822",
"who": "GLAMOURTOAD",
"ctx": "Fables101/env_andersenwoodsmanapt",
"en": "Wait, you saw this guy? When? How's that even possible?"
}
]